.TH SMFLAT 1
.SH NAME
smflat \- write the flat pattern of a part as DXF
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B smflat \-f dxf
.I part.fold
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Smflat
writes the unfolded blank of a part as DXF on the standard output,
in mm.
The fold file must hold one part.
Layer OUTLINE holds the cut contour, with true arcs and circles;
layer BEND holds a centre line for each bend zone.
.SH SEE ALSO
smfold(1), fold(5)
